      "observed": "The MIC26903 feedback divider is drawn with R9 = 19.6 kΩ and R10 = 1.3 kΩ. Using the schematic's stated relation, Vout = 0.8*(1+R5/R6), these values imply about 12.9 V rather than 5 V.",
