          "quote": "REG2 MIC26903YJL-TR; 9A @ 5V max. [Power sheet, page 1]"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "A MIC26903YJL-TR synchronous buck regulator steps the battery input down to 5 V. [§4]"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The regulator may produce a voltage far above the intended 5 V rail, potentially damaging or disrupting the servo-power and other 5 V loads.",
      "confidence": 0.88
